cha.&lt;br&gt;Chỉ vẽ quan hệ trong phân hệ; liên kết sang phân hệ khác liệt kê ở hộp bên dưới, đủ trên ERD-00.&lt;br&gt;Lược bỏ: quan hệ Tenant và quan hệ người tạo/duyệt tới User – xem Data Design.&lt;br&gt;* ReplenishmentSuggestion chưa có entity C#." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=6;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1242" y="120" width="400" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n-33" value="&lt;b&gt;Liên kết sang phân hệ khác&lt;/b&gt; (cha – động từ – con, 1 – nhiều)&lt;br&gt;Branch (trang 01) &lt;i&gt;adjusts&lt;/i&gt; InventoryAdjustment&lt;br&gt;Branch (trang 01) &lt;i&gt;posts&lt;/i&gt; InventoryTransaction&lt;br&gt;Branch (trang 01) &lt;i&gt;stocks&lt;/i&gt; InventoryBalance&lt;br&gt;GoodsReceiptItem (trang 04) &lt;i&gt;posted as&lt;/i&gt; InventoryTransaction&lt;br&gt;OrderItem (trang 08) &lt;i&gt;posted as&lt;/i&gt; InventoryTransaction&lt;br&gt;ProductVariant (trang 02) &lt;i&gt;adjusted in&lt;/i&gt; InventoryAdjustmentItem&lt;br&gt;ProductVariant (trang 02) &lt;i&gt;balanced in&lt;/i&gt; InventoryBalance&lt;br&gt;ProductVariant (trang 02) &lt;i&gt;balanced in&lt;/i&gt; WarehouseInventoryBalance&lt;br&gt;ProductVariant (trang 02) &lt;i&gt;moves&lt;/i&gt; InventoryTransaction&lt;br&gt;SalesReturnItem (trang 09) &lt;i&gt;posted as&lt;/i&gt; InventoryTransaction&lt;br&gt;StockCountItem (trang 07) &lt;i&gt;posted as&lt;/i&gt; InventoryTransaction&lt;br&gt;StockTransferItem (trang 06) &lt;i&gt;posted as&lt;/i&gt; InventoryTransaction&lt;br&gt;Warehouse (trang 01) &lt;i&gt;adjusts&lt;/i&gt; InventoryAdjustment&lt;br&gt;Warehouse (trang 01) &lt;i&gt;posts&lt;/i&gt; InventoryTransaction&lt;br&gt;Warehouse (trang 01) &lt;i&gt;stocks&lt;/i&gt; WarehouseInventoryBalance" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=6;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1242" y="330" width="400" he